<%- include('../partials/top', { title }) %>

<div class="pagehead"><h1>Rating settings</h1></div>

<div class="card stack form-narrow">
  <p>The weekly score measures shortfall from 100% completion:</p>
  <p class="formula">score = (done ÷ planned − 1) × 100 &nbsp; <span class="muted">(0 is best, −100 is worst)</span></p>
  <p class="muted">Set the minimum score for each rating. Example: green at −10 means a doer stays green while completing 90% or more of their week.</p>

  <form method="post" action="/scores/thresholds" class="stack">
    <label class="field">
      <span><span class="badge badge-green">GREEN</span> when score is at least</span>
      <input type="number" name="green" step="1" min="-100" max="0" required value="<%= th.green %>">
    </label>
    <label class="field">
      <span><span class="badge badge-yellow">YELLOW</span> when score is at least</span>
      <input type="number" name="yellow" step="1" min="-100" max="0" required value="<%= th.yellow %>">
    </label>
    <p class="muted small">Anything below yellow is <span class="badge badge-red">RED</span>.</p>
    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-big btn-block" type="submit">Save</button>
  </form>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/bottom') %>
